---
source: crates/dsql-core/tests/it/completions.rs
expression: "format!(\"pipe replace={:?}:\\n{}\\n\\npartial pipe replace={:?}:\\n{}\\n\\nfunctions:\\n{functions}\\n\\noperands:\\n{operands}\\n\\ngroup keys:\\n{group_keys}\\n\\nrooted group keys:\\n{rooted_group_keys}\",\npipe.replace, render_completion_items(&pipe), partial_pipe.replace,\nrender_completion_items(&partial_pipe),)"
---
pipe replace=None:
Keyword aggregate (selection transform)

partial pipe replace=Some(Span { start: 28, end: 32 }):
Keyword aggregate (selection transform)

functions:
Keyword avg (aggregate function)
Keyword count (aggregate function)
Keyword exists (aggregate function)
Keyword max (aggregate function)
Keyword min (aggregate function)
Keyword sum (aggregate function)

operands:
Column created_at (timestamptz)
Column email (text)
Column id (uuid)
Column name (text)

group keys:
Column created_at (timestamptz) insert=.created_at
Column email (text) insert=.email
Column id (uuid) insert=.id
Column name (text) insert=.name

rooted group keys:
Column created_at (timestamptz)
Column email (text)
Column id (uuid)
Column name (text)
